    "created_at": "2017-11-03T18:24:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-11-03T18:24:25Z",
    "body": "> Not to defend what seems like poor taste in an algorithm name, it seems like these refer to actual algorithms used by browsers, rather than just a joke:\r\n\r\nThanks for researching that! Googling turned up nothing useful. I suppose the question becomes: is documenting the names of algorithms that are no longer used of benefit to the spec, given the language is distasteful?",
